// How the tool in hand moves (crates/pbd-app/src/held.rs). The tools' shapes,
// their held poses and the hand are not here: they are generated data,
// assets/models/held_tools.ron, written by tools/gen_held_tools.py from the
// approved Hex Tool Bench mockup (openspec/changes/hex-held-tools).
//
// The idle sway (amplitude right and up, m, and rate, rad/s) and the chop
// while a block is being broken (rate, rad/s; drop, m; pitch about the fist,
// rad) are Tenebris's viewmodel's.
//
// The code defaults written out; a test holds the two together.
(
    sway_m: (0.006, 0.005),
    sway_rate: (1.3, 1.7),
    swing_rate: 9.0,
    swing_drop_m: 0.06,
    swing_pitch_rad: 0.85,
)
